Z||000011||DXR_DAD||06-15-2000||07:50 PM||||Sorry guys it took so long to get back to ya<P>The lights I bought from Grand Auto they are<BR>trailer/axu back-up lights. I was looking for somthing that would fit in the bone yards<BR>and yes there are many cars that have lights that will fit??? you need to check, <P>If you are doing this mod you DO NOT need to remove the bumper just break out the reflectors. There is steel/frame that you can<BR>use to mount new lights. Once you remove the old reflectors you will see what type of lights & mount you can use.    ?? You have to remove/break out the old reflectors and come up with your own way of mounting the lights<BR>You can also mount to the fascia, the sides/inside the reflector cutouts.<BR>It's not a big or a hard job.<P>I did not take pics or document this mod  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>so I don't remember the re-wire? and the blub<BR>size? but if you need it I will take it apart<BR>to give you that info.<P>O'yea the old back up lights are worthless<BR>with these you can SEE!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>fropuff, Email me if you need more info.<P><BR>DXR_DAD ||||reg||14
